OL,3,GNEWSAFour more people face arson charge
OL,4,Aover wildfire
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour more people have been charged with
OL,7,Farson in connection with a wildfire.
OL,9,FThe blaze at Dove Stone reservoir, near
OL,10,FGreenfield, Saddleworth, Greater
OL,11,FManchester, broke out on 11 July and
OL,12,Fwas declared a major incident by the
OL,13,Ffire service. It took more than three
OL,14,Fweeks to extinguish.
